Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.50,0:29:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我不要 我不要\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}No, I don't want it. I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.45,0:29:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我没给你情报 只有讲话而已\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I didn't give you any information. I was just\Ntalking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.37,0:29:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}那不是情报\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}That's not for information.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.20,0:29:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}是付他的帐单\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}It's to cover his tab.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.33,0:30:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我找贾努领主\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I'm looking for Lord Janu.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.37,0:30:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}你可能搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Maybe you made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.25,0:30:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}你可能记错 以为你认识我\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Maybe you remember wrong and think you know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.45,0:30:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}或许你找错地方了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Maybe you just walked through the wrong door.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.00,0:30:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我不是来买盐的\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Well, I'm not here to buy salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.87,0:30:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}盐\N{\rEng}Salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.20,0:30:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我们不卖盐\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}We don't sell salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.50,0:30:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}它是配给的\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}It's on the ration.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.08,0:30:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}你肩上的小可爱多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}How much for the shoulder candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.95,0:31:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}适合养在笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Would look real pretty in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.91,0:31:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我来见贾努领主\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I'm here to see Lord Janu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.87,0:31:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我不会再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I won't repeat myself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.75,0:32:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}你今天的表现没白费\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}It seems you've earned your salt today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.20,0:32:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我是贾努\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I'm Janu.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.33,0:32:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}到后面来挑颗水晶盐\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Come to the back and pick out a crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.79,0:32:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}哈斯布雷 叫他们清理一下\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Hogsbreth, have the boys clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.45,0:32:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}宠物一只都不能少\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Make sure I don't lose any pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.25,0:32:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}来\N{\rEng}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.00,0:32:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}挑一颗\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Choose one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.25,0:32:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}盐在我老家没有价值\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Salt is of no value to me where I'm from.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.95,0:32:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}在这里价值不菲\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}But here it's worth a small fortune,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.25,0:32:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}因为是由政治人物配给的\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}because it's rationed by the politicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.00,0:32:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}所以很稀有\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Which makes it rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.95,0:32:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}你也一样 曼达洛人\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}As are you, Mandalorian.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.20,0:32:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}考虑过来斗技坑比赛吗？\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Have you ever considered fighting in the pits?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.37,0:32:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我尽量避免暴力\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I try to avoid violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.79,0:33:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}那当然\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}'Course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.00,0:33:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我也是\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I do as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.04,0:33:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}如果不买盐 什么风把你吹来\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}So what brings you to this establishment if you're\Nnot in the market for salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.45,0:33:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我想买断你旗下一名斗士的合约\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I wanna buy out the contract on a fighter from your\Nstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.04,0:33:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}也许你能考虑加入我旗下\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Perhaps you would consider joining my stable\Ninstead?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.87,0:33:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}这在我老家能买不少盐\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}This buys a lot of salt where I'm from.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.50,0:33:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}用来交换赫特人罗塔的格斗合约\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I am offering you this in exchange for the fighting\Ncontract on Rotta the Hutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.62,0:33:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}再高的价钱也买不到他最后一战\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}My dear boy, there's no price high enough to buy\Nhim out of his last fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.25,0:33:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我培训他好多周期了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I've been grooming that little prince for many\Ncycles,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.25,0:33:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}准备迎接明天的比赛\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}setting him up for tomorrow's match.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.95,0:33:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}收下信用币\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Take the credits.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.08,0:33:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}反正是他为你打的最后一战\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}It's his last fight for you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.41,0:33:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}他毕生最后一战\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}It's his last fight ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.29,0:33:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我搜集来自银河系各地的致命动物\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I've collected the most deadly creatures from\Nacross the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.87,0:33:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}他要上场比异兽棋\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}He's fighting a Dejarik match?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.37,0:33:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}对\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.20,0:33:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}他明天就会死\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}He will die tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.95,0:33:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}只有少数几人知道\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}And a select few know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.33,0:33:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我送你以下的赠礼\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Here's my gift to you:
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.70,0:34:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}用这些信用币 下注那个赫特人会死\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}take those credits, bet it all on the death of the\NHutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.87,0:34:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我只要你考虑在我的斗技坑出赛\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}In exchange, all I ask is that you consider\Nfighting in my pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.00,0:34:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}沙卡里人愿不计代价目睹奇观\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}The people of Shakari would pay any price to see\Nthe rarest of sights,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.20,0:34:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}传奇曼达洛战士参加血腥运动\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}one of the legendary Mandalorian warriors engaging\Nin blood sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.12,0:34:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}这应该能弥补我们的小误会\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}This should more than cover our little\Nmisunderstanding out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.04,0:34:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我只要求你考虑我的提议\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}All I ask is that you consider my offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.87,0:34:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我们俩都能发大财\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Could make us both very rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.33,0:35:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}看来我们只能来硬的了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Looks like we're gonna have to do this the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.04,0:36:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}什么\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.45,0:36:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}贾努打算杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Janu's planning on killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.12,0:36:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我救你出去\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I'm here to get you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.58,0:36:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}明天是最后一场 打赢就自由了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Tomorrow's my last fight. I'll be free after I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.58,0:37:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}胜负已定 那是异兽棋比赛\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}The fix is in. It's a Dejarik match.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.04,0:37:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}他会不断派出对手 直到你死\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}He will keep throwing opponents at you until you\Ndie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.95,0:37:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我何必相信你\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Why should I believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.20,0:37:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我堂叔堂姑派你来 他们要我死\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}You were sent by my aunt and uncle who want me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.62,0:37:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}他们要你回去\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}They want you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.33,0:37:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}你害他们丢脸\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}You're embarrassing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.87,0:37:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}双胞胎要我死\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}The Twins want me dead
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.33,0:37:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}因为王位继承人是我 不是他们\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}because I'm heir to the throne, not them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.70,0:37:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}但我不要王位\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}But I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.33,0:37:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我根本不想和我父亲一样\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I don't wanna be anything like my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.75,0:37:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}刚开始参赛 观众都嘘我\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}When I first started fighting, the people all booed\Nme.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.91,0:37:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}他们想看我死\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}They wanted to see me die
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.54,0:37:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}因为我是赫特人贾巴的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}because I'm the son of Jabba the Hutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.62,0:37:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}后来我赢得冠军\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Then I won and became a champion
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.50,0:37:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}他们才慢慢开始欢呼\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}and they slowly began to cheer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.66,0:37:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}他们明白我不是我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}They realized I'm not my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.75,0:37:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我是我自己\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I'm my own man,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.25,0:37:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我不怕捍卫自己\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}and I'm not afraid to fight for what I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.66,0:37:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}努力争取 向大家证明自己\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}To earn it. To prove myself to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.41,0:37:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}孩子 格斗不是运动\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Kid, fighting's not a sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.12,0:37:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}它是最后的手段\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}It's a last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.04,0:37:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}跟我来 以免无法收拾\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Now come with me before things get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.20,0:37:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}警卫 他回来了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Guards, he's back
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.58,0:37:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}出去\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Get out. Get out
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.00,0:38:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}罗塔\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Rotta Rotta Rotta
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.00,0:39:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}罗塔\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Rotta
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.33,0:39:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我不想跟你打\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I don't want to fight you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.66,0:39:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}那你今天有得受了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Then you're in for a long day
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.16,0:39:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}好啊\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.79,0:40:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我不会杀你\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I'm not going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.62,0:40:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我是来救你的\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I'm here to rescue you.
