Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.12,0:51:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我听过那些怪物的不少事迹\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I've heard many things about those monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.91,0:51:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}全是真的\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}It's all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.75,0:51:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}帝国指挥官贾努·科因\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Imperial Commander Janu Coin,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.00,0:51:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我代表新共和国来将你绳之以法\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I'm here on behalf of the New Republic to bring you\Nto justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.00,0:51:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我们不在你的管辖范围内\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I'm afraid we're outside of your jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.25,0:51:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Take him
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.37,0:51:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}火力全开 -快点\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}-Set blasters on full. -Hurry
