Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.16,1:16:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}让敌人看见你的脸 你会遭流放\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}You will be outcast for letting an enemy see your\Nface.
