Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.29,1:17:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}罗塔原本会平静死去\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Rotta would have died painlessly,
