Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.37,1:40:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}你喂这个给他吃\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I want you to feed this to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.95,1:40:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}你该知道 可能来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Now, you should know, this might be too little, too\Nlate,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.62,1:40:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}他很可能不会醒来\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}and there's a good chance he doesn't wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.79,1:40:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}反正 现在只能让他舒服点\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Either way, best thing you can do right now is make\Nhim comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.41,1:40:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}人生终须一别\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}There comes a time where we all have to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.83,1:40:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}祝你好运 小旅人\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I wish you luck, small traveler.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.00,1:43:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}孩子\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Hey, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.83,1:43:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}老者保护幼者 幼者保护老者\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}The old protect the young, and then the young\Nprotect the old.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.16,1:43:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我辈之道\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}This is the Way.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.66,1:44:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我们如何离开这星球\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Now how do we get off this planet?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.50,1:44:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}那是带走罗塔的军火商\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}That's the gunrunner that was carrying Rotta.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.70,1:46:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}孩子 我看我们有两个选择\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Well, kid, the way I see it we got two choices.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.12,1:46:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我们能靠这艘船离开\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}We can use this ship. Get off world.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.25,1:46:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}或许能争取点时间 一点平静\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}That might buy us some time. A little bit of peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.25,1:46:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}但赫特人会不断来找我们\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}But the Hutts will keep coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.54,1:46:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}就像他们来找罗塔一样\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Just like they came for Rotta.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.41,1:46:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}所以要逃吗？\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}So, do we run?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.79,1:46:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}还是要反抗\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Or do we fight?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.58,1:47:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}击退入侵者\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Repel the intruders
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.45,1:47:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}收到\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Roger, roger
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.83,1:47:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}保护王宫\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Protect the palace
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.12,1:47:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}是\N{\rEng}Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.58,1:48:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}听我的指示\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Follow my lead.
