Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.16,1:48:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}快啊\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.50,1:49:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}On me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.70,1:49:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}后退\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Fall back
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.25,1:52:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}等等 我们知道的不少\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Wait We know much.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.41,1:52:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}去救罗塔\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Go help Rotta.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.12,1:52:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}你们看过我的脸\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}You saw my face.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.58,1:52:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}住手\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Stop
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.33,1:52:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}死期到了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Now it's time to die.
