Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.00,1:56:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}救救我们 赏金猎人\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Save us, bounty hunter Keibu.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.00,1:56:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}救救我们\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Save us
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.00,1:57:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}时间不多 我们得快离开\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}We don't have much time. We have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.62,1:57:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}有别的出路吗？\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Is there another way out?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.91,1:57:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}-应该是那边 -快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}-I think it's that way. -Go. Go
