Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.25,1:58:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}-喂 -曼多 我们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}-Hello? -Mando We came back.
