Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.83,2:00:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}锁定目标\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Locking in target.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.66,2:00:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}这是死路\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}It's a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.00,2:00:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我们困住了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.12,2:00:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}让开\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.70,2:01:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我们快靠近了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}We're closing fast.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.12,2:01:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}重复 快靠近了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Repeat, we're closing fast.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.91,2:01:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}你最好离开 曼多\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}You better be out of there, Mando.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.29,2:01:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}跳\N{\rEng}Jump.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.79,2:01:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}这里好高啊\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}That's a long way down.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.95,2:01:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}接近目标\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Closing on target.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.70,2:01:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}-非跳不可 -壕沟没那么深\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}-Gotta jump. -Moat's not that deep.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.08,2:01:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}是轰炸机 跳\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}It's a bomber. Jump.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.20,2:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}轰了这座丛林沼泽\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Let's light up this swamp.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.79,2:01:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}有人看见曼多吗？\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Anybody got eyes on Mando?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.95,2:01:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}他们在那里\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}There they are.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.50,2:02:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}泽布 该收垃圾了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Zeb, go collect the trash.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.37,2:02:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我受够了这些营救行动\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I'm getting a little tired of these hot extractions.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.08,2:02:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}怎么这么久才来\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.33,2:02:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}上来吧\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Hop in.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.58,2:02:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我们回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Let's head home.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.33,2:02:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}上校\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.91,2:02:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}乱来\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Messy.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.00,2:02:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}真是太乱来了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Very messy.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.45,2:03:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}为什么来救我 这不在任务范围内吧\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Why'd you come for me? That wasn't part of the\Nmission.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.41,2:03:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}你说得对 科因全都招了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}You were right. Coin told us everything.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.04,2:03:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}双胞胎一直在耍我们\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}The Twins were playing us.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.75,2:03:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}给帝国提供情报\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Feeding information to the Empire all along.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.62,2:03:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}他们站队了 站的不是我们\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}They picked a side. It wasn't ours.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.91,2:03:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}而且 我们不会抛弃自己人\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Besides, we don't leave our own behind.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.08,2:03:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我是独立承包商\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}I'm an independent contractor.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.95,2:03:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}是 曼多 你当然是\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Sure, Mando. Sure you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.58,2:03:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我能载你去哪里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Can I give you a ride somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.58,2:03:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我在想我能留下来\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Actually, I was thinking I could stay here.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.58,2:03:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}或许为新共和国工作\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Maybe work for the New Republic.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:40.95,2:03:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}别误会 但我觉得你不适合\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Don't take this the wrong way, but I'm not sure you\Nwould fit in.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.62,2:03:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}其实 我有制服适合他穿\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}You know I might have a uniform that would fit him.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.83,2:03:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}走吧 我请你喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Come on, let me buy you a drink.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.50,2:03:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}谢谢你曼多 我欠你一次\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Thank you, Mando. I owe you big time.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.12,2:03:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}我只是尽忠职守\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Just doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.08,2:04:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}好好看着他\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}And keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.20,2:04:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}你有个好爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Your dad's one of the good ones.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.29,2:04:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}走吧 大个子\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Come on, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.75,2:04:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}小心走 第一轮我请客\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Watch your step. First round's on me.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.29,2:04:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}孩子 上来\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Hey, kid. Come up here.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.08,2:04:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.20,2:04:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSource Han Sans SC\fs20\fsp0\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H00&\b1\i0}动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs14\fsp0\c&H66D9FF&\alpha&H00&\b0\i0}{\rEng}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.12,2:05:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs20\b1\pos(192,202)}曼达洛人与古古
